@startuml UC-12-Mengelola-Users
title Sequence Diagram: Mengelola Users (Admin)

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "Dashboard Admin\nHalaman Kelola Users\n(React)" as UI
participant "GET /api/admin/users\nPUT /api/admin/users/:id\nDELETE /api/admin/users/:id" as API
participant "AdminUserController" as Controller
participant "AdminUserService" as Service
database "PostgreSQL\n(tabel Akun,\ntabel Pengguna,\ntabel AuditLog)" as DB

Admin -> UI: Mengakses menu\n"Kelola Users"
activate UI
UI -> API: GET /api/admin/users
activate API
API -> Controller: getAllUsers()
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: getUserList()
activate Service
Service -> DB: SELECT * FROM Akun\nORDER BY tanggalDaftar DESC
activate DB
DB --> Service: Return array semua pengguna\n(ID, Nama, Email, Role,\nStatus, Tanggal Daftar, XP)
deactivate DB
Service --> Controller: { success: true, data: [...] }
Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
API --> UI: Data pengguna
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
UI --> Admin: Menampilkan tabel pengguna\ndengan kolom lengkap
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan filter (role, status)\ndan pencarian
Admin -> UI: Memilih pengguna\n(klik row)
UI --> Admin: Menampilkan detail dan\nmenu aksi: Edit Role,\nSuspend, Hapus

== Flow Normal - Edit Role ==

Admin -> UI: Pilih aksi "Edit Role"
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan dialog\npilihan role (User, Admin)
Admin -> UI: Pilih role baru\n(misal: User ke Admin)
Admin -> UI: Klik "Simpan"
UI -> API: PUT /api/admin/users/:id/role\n{ newRole: 'Admin' }
activate API
API -> Controller: updateRole(id)
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: changeUserRole(id, newRole, adminId)
activate Service
Service -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
activate DB
Service -> DB: UPDATE Akun SET\nrole = '[newRole]'\nWHERE idAkun = '[id]'
DB --> Service: UPDATE success
Service -> DB: INSERT INTO AuditLog\n(admin_id, action, target_user_id,\ndetails, timestamp)\nVALUES ('[adminId]', 'edit_role',\n'[userId]', 'Changed role to Admin',\nNOW())
DB --> Service: Audit log saved
Service -> DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
DB --> Service: Transaction committed
deactivate DB
Service --> Controller: { success: true }
Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
API --> UI: Response sukses
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan notifikasi\n"Role berhasil diubah"
UI -> UI: Refresh daftar pengguna
deactivate UI

== Alternate Flow A - Suspend Akun ==

Admin -> UI: Pilih aksi "Suspend Akun"
activate UI
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan konfirmasi\n"Yakin suspend akun?\nPengguna tidak dapat login"
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan field "Alasan Suspend"
Admin -> UI: Isi alasan suspend
Admin -> UI: Klik "Ya, Suspend"
UI -> API: PUT /api/admin/users/:id/suspend\n{ alasanSuspend: "..." }
activate API
API -> Controller: suspendUser(id)
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: suspendAccount(id, reason, adminId)
activate Service
Service -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
activate DB
Service -> DB: UPDATE Akun SET\nstatusAktif = false,\nalasanSuspend = '[reason]'\nWHERE idAkun = '[id]'
DB --> Service: UPDATE success
Service -> DB: INSERT INTO AuditLog\n(admin_id, action, target_user_id,\ndetails, timestamp)\nVALUES ('[adminId]', 'suspend',\n'[userId]', '[reason]', NOW())
DB --> Service: Audit log saved
Service -> DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
DB --> Service: Transaction committed
deactivate DB
Service --> Controller: { success: true }
Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
API --> UI: Response sukses
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan notifikasi\n"Akun berhasil disuspend"
UI -> UI: Update status pengguna\ndi tabel
deactivate UI

== Alternate Flow B - Hapus Akun ==

Admin -> UI: Pilih aksi "Hapus Akun"
activate UI
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan peringatan\n"PERHATIAN: Hapus permanen.\nSemua data (materi, kuis,\nriwayat) akan terhapus"
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan field konfirmasi\n(harus ketik "HAPUS")
Admin -> UI: Ketik "HAPUS"
Admin -> UI: Klik "Ya, Hapus Permanen"
UI -> API: DELETE /api/admin/users/:id
activate API
API -> Controller: deleteUser(id)
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: deleteAccount(id, adminId)
activate Service
Service -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
activate DB
Service -> DB: SELECT fileUrls FROM Materi\nWHERE idPenulis = '[id]'\n(cek file S3 yang perlu dihapus)
DB --> Service: Return list file URLs
Service -> DB: DELETE FROM Akun\nWHERE idAkun = '[id]'\n(cascade delete ke Materi,\nKuis, RiwayatBelajar,\nKomentar, Rating)
DB --> Service: CASCADE DELETE success
Service -> DB: INSERT INTO AuditLog\n(admin_id, action, target_user_id,\ndetails)\nVALUES ('[adminId]', 'delete_user',\n'[userId]', 'Permanent delete')
DB --> Service: Audit log saved
Service -> DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
DB --> Service: Transaction committed
deactivate DB
Service ->> S3: Delete files terkait\ndari S3 (background task)
Service --> Controller: { success: true }
Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
API --> UI: Response sukses
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan notifikasi\n"Akun berhasil dihapus"
UI -> UI: Hapus entry dari tabel
deactivate UI

== Alternate Flow C - Unsuspend Akun ==

Admin -> UI: Pilih akun suspended,\nklik "Aktifkan Kembali"
activate UI
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan konfirmasi
Admin -> UI: Klik "Ya, Aktifkan"
UI -> API: PUT /api/admin/users/:id/unsuspend
activate API
API -> Controller: unsuspendUser(id)
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: unsuspendAccount(id, adminId)
activate Service
Service -> DB: UPDATE Akun SET\nstatusAktif = true,\nalasanSuspend = NULL\nWHERE idAkun = '[id]'
activate DB
DB --> Service: UPDATE success
deactivate DB
Service -> DB: INSERT INTO AuditLog\n(admin_id, action, target_user_id)\nVALUES ('[adminId]', 'unsuspend',\n'[userId]')
activate DB
DB --> Service: Log saved
deactivate DB
Service --> Controller: { success: true }
Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
API --> UI: Response sukses
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan notifikasi\n"Akun diaktifkan kembali"
UI -> UI: Update status di tabel
deactivate UI

== Exception: Error Suspend Admin Lain ==

note over Service
  Jika admin mencoba suspend
  admin lain dengan level sama
  atau lebih tinggi:
  - Tampilkan error "Unauthorized"
  - Operasi dibatalkan
end note

@enduml
